Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.15,0:04:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.94,0:02:35.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(没有汽油)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.76,0:03:31.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.88,0:03:34.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a policeman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.88,0:03:36.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.66,0:03:43.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要怕　好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be afraid, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.97,0:03:48.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.05,0:05:03.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男女之间有什么差别\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the difference between men and women?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.41,0:05:06.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你开玩笑吗　-不　认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is this a joke? - No, serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.19,0:05:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没见过一个女人懂得关灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never met a woman who knew how to turn off a light.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.18,0:05:13.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们生来只知道开灯　从来不懂关灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're born thinking the switch only goes one way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.93,0:05:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们一离开一个房间就会被“闪瞎”\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're struck blind the second they leave a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个我曾给过家里钥匙的女人都这样　我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean every woman, I ever let have a key, I swear to God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:24.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比方说我一到家　整栋房子灯火通明\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like I... come home, house all lit up,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.44,0:05:27.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我的任务呢　显而易见…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my job, apparently because...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.20,0:05:30.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我是男性\N{\fnArial\fs30}because my chromosomes happen to be different
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.17,0:05:32.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我得跑遍整栋房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}cause I then gotta walk through that house,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.23,0:05:34.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把所有她没关的灯全关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}turn off every single light this chick left on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.94,0:05:36.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是么　-当然了　哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that right? - Yeah, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.86,0:05:40.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧　肖恩神父要开始布道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, Reverend Shane's preaching to you now, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.98,0:05:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个小妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same chick, mind ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.60,0:05:47.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又在念叨全球变暖问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll bitch about global warming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.30,0:05:50.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肖恩神父要开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, this is -- this is when Reverend Shane wants to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:53.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,引用盖伊福音了\N{\fnArial\fs30}quote from the Guy Gospel and say "Um, darling?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.10,0:05:57.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“亲爱的　要是你和这星球上的其他小妞”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"maybe you, and every other pair of boobs on this planet
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.64,0:06:00.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“懂得开了灯就要关”\N{\fnArial\fs30}just figured out that the light switch see, goes both ways,"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.93,0:06:03.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“那全球变暖可能就没这么严重了”\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe we wouldn't have so much global warming."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.57,0:06:05.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你这么说吗　-对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You say that? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.83,0:06:08.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样　还算很客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, uh... Polite version...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:11.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但结果呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still man, that... that earns me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.32,0:06:14.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她丢给你一副厌恶的嘴脸　你肯定想像不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}This look and loathing you would not believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.07,0:06:17.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驱魔人一般的声音蹦出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's when the exorcist voice pops out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.18,0:06:19.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“你怎么跟我那该死的老爸似的”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You sound just like my damn father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.21,0:06:22.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“总是唠叨电费”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Always,always yelling about the power bill,"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.35,0:06:24.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“要我关灯”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"telling me to turn off the damn lights."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.76,0:06:25.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.89,0:06:27.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I wanna say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.52,0:06:29.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想说　“贱人”\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna say,"Bitch, you mean to tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.12,0:06:30.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“原来早就有人和你说过了”\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've been hearing this your entire　life
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.77,0:06:33.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“你却还是蠢到学不会关灯”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and you are still too damn stupid to learn how to turn off a switch?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.02,0:06:39.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我没有这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know... I don't actually say that,tho.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.35,0:06:42.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那样就惨了　-用那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That would be bad. - Yeah, go with the uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.52,0:06:43.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,客气的说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}the polite version there...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.64,0:06:46.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-还真明智　-可不是　长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Very wise. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.24,0:06:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和洛莉怎么样了　伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how's it with Lori, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.22,0:06:56.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她很不错　懂得关灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's good. She's good at turning off lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.66,0:06:57.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.01,0:07:00.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道为何我们还是会怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why sometimes we guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.47,0:07:02.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.68,0:07:07.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们处得不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't have a great night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.15,0:07:12.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着　伙计　我可能是缺乏幽默感　但我会尽力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, I may have a... fail to amuse with my sermon, but I did try.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.93,0:07:15.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少你能说说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}The least you could do is speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:20.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她总这么说　“说话”\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what she always says: "Speak".
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.45,0:07:22.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“说话”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Speak".
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.30,0:07:25.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她这么说我还保持缄默\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I was the most closed mouth
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.38,0:07:27.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你大概觉得我逊毙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}son of a bitch you'd ever hear to hear her tell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.85,0:07:32.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有说过你的想法么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you express your thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.79,0:07:35.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有分享过你的感受之类的么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You share your feelings and that kind of stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.32,0:07:38.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.23,0:07:43.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管我怎么尝试\N{\fnArial\fs30}lately whenever I try...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:48.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她都很不耐烦　好像她根本不想听\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything I say makes her impatient,like she didn't want to hear it after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:51.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉就好像…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like she's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.77,0:07:54.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她总会无缘无故地生我气\N{\fnArial\fs30}pissed at me all the time, and I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.09,0:07:58.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着　伙计　夫妻间都会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, that's just shit couples go through.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.81,0:08:01.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总得经历这段时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, it's... It's a phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.41,0:08:07.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道她今早说的最后一句话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last thing she said this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:11.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说“有时我甚至怀疑你根本不在乎我们”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I wonder if you even care about us at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.35,0:08:16.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她当着孩子的面就这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said that in front of our kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.75,0:08:20.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想看他去学校后会怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine going to school with that in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:26.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男女之间的区别吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Difference between men and women?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.07,0:08:30.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不会对她说这么残酷的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would never say something that cruel to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.62,0:08:34.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是在卡尔面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly not in front of Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.00,0:08:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有空闲单位　林肯县发生高速追捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}All available units, high speed pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.20,0:08:44.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请即刻到现场增援\N{\fnArial\fs30}in progress Lincoln county units request local assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.64,0:08:48.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,18号公路以南 GTAAD记录217-243以西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Highway 18 south GTAAD W217-243.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.97,0:08:51.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高度戒备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proceed with extreme caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.32,0:09:05.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嫌犯为两名高加索白人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suspects are two male Caucasians.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.36,0:09:07.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通知各单位　嫌犯已向警方开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be advised, they have fired on police officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.21,0:09:10.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一位林肯县警受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}One Lincoln county officer is wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.78,0:09:21.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一组和三组注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unit 1, Unit 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.02,0:09:24.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,85州际公路以西2英里处\N{\fnArial\fs30}18, 2 miles west of Interstate 85
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.03,0:09:26.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,使用林肯县警无线电保持联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll patch in Linclon County Sheriff radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.51,0:09:30.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到　还有5分钟赶到18号公路口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that. We're 5 minutes out on the route 18 intersection.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.58,0:09:35.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一组三组注意　到达现场后设立路障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dispatch, Unit 1, Unit 3, we are 10-97 in code 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.20,0:09:38.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,85州际公路　18号公路　请下达指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Highway 18, 85 Interstate, please advise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.96,0:09:58.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着像是那些蠢货被追得东逃西窜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like they're chasing those idiots up and down every back road we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.32,0:10:00.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可得拍个录像传网上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we'll get them on one of those video shows, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.21,0:10:02.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弄个“最疯狂警匪追逐”视频　你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}like World's craziest police chases, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.10,0:10:04.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你该专心点　里昂\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I think, Leon, is that you need to stay focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:07.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别被迎面来的子弹给崩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you got a round in the chamber and your safety off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.52,0:10:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样视频可就拉风得多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would be kind of cool to get on one of them shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.28,0:11:05.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真他妈见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.19,0:11:30.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-小心有枪　-放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gun, gun, gun. - Put it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.28,0:11:31.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the gun down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.21,0:12:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-瑞克　-我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rick! - I'm alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.95,0:12:15.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到你被击中了　吓死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you get tagged, man, it scared the hell out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.21,0:12:18.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.24,0:12:19.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那见鬼丫的居然开枪打我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch shot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.85,0:12:21.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你相信么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.33,0:12:23.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时给你件新防弹衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get you a new vest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.69,0:12:24.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.26,0:12:28.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肖恩　你可不能告诉洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane, you do not tell Lori that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.81,0:12:30.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:31.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.67,0:12:36.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克　不　不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick! Rick! No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.79,0:12:41.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不　他受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no... He's hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.63,0:12:43.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里昂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.94,0:12:45.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去叫救护车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get that ambulance down here,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.70,0:12:47.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去叫救护车　说有警官受伤　快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}you tell them there's an officer down, you do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:51.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看着我　保持清醒　好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh, shh, shh, hey, you look at me, stay with me, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.55,0:12:55.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事　保持清醒　听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Shh, shh, stay with me, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.33,0:12:59.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗　保持清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh, shh, ok? You stay with me, ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.39,0:13:20.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计　我们还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, bud... We're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:23.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天都在\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still hanging in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.62,0:13:29.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着　我很抱歉　伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.35,0:13:32.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我每次来你都是这副德行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm mean watching the same crap every time I come in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.90,0:13:38.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是大家一起买的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody pitched in on these. They uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:41.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们要我带过来　致以他们的问候…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wanted me to bring them down, they send their love and they just...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.98,0:13:44.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们希望你快点好起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hope you come back real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.84,0:13:51.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总台的琳达和戴安　这是她们选的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linda and Diane from dispatch, they picked these out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.03,0:13:54.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该能看出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably could tell, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.85,0:13:58.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就放在桌上了　好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just set this on your side table, ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.22,0:14:11.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还不是一般的花瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}That vase has something special.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.42,0:14:12.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fess up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.71,0:14:15.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是从吉恩奶奶家偷来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you steal it from your Grandma Gene's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.76,0:14:18.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但愿你没碰她收藏的汤匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you left her that spoon collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.41,0:14:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.71,0:14:34.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肖恩　你在厕所吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane, you in the john?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.70,0:15:53.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,护士　快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nurse, help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.19,0:15:58.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,护士　来帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nurse. Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.19,0:18:30.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(不要开门　里面有僵尸)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.73,0:23:50.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.02,0:23:53.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.38,0:24:04.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔　卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl! Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.56,0:24:12.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洛莉　卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori! Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.49,0:24:29.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洛莉　卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori! Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.57,0:24:48.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this real?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.87,0:24:50.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的在这吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.68,0:24:59.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醒过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.26,0:26:14.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy, daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.56,0:26:17.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl... Carl?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.30,0:26:19.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我找到你了…　-爸爸　我搞定这混球了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I found you... - Daddy, I got this sumbitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.39,0:26:21.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要敲死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna smack him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.55,0:26:29.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.67,0:26:30.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好像听见他说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I heard him say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.88,0:26:33.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他叫我卡尔　-孩子　你也知道他们不说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He called me Carl. - Son, you know they don't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.59,0:26:37.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生　你为什么绑着绷带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, mister! What's that bandage for?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.00,0:26:41.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么　-你受了什么伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - What kind of wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.03,0:26:44.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快回答我　见鬼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You answer me, damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.64,0:26:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你受了什么伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.42,0:26:49.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.69,0:26:52.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我就杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.52,0:27:17.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们帮你换了绷带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got that bandage changed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.92,0:27:20.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经脏得不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was pretty rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.31,0:27:21.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.82,0:27:23.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.06,0:27:25.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-枪伤　-枪伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gun shot. - Gun shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.05,0:27:29.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有其他什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else? Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.00,0:27:32.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光是枪伤还不够惨吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gun shot ain't enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.73,0:27:38.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听好了　我问你答　规矩知不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I ask and you answer, It's common courtesy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.93,0:27:44.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没被咬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.77,0:27:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-咬　-咬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bit? - Bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.07,0:27:49.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咬过　还是被抓过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewed. Maybe scratch?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.68,0:27:51.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何诸如此类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.16,0:27:54.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没　我被枪打了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,I got shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.75,0:27:57.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就我所知　只有枪伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just shot, as far as I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.53,0:28:03.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我量下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey... Just let me...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.35,0:28:07.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉凉多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels cooler now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.42,0:28:10.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发烧的话你这会就没命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fever would have killed you by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.21,0:28:12.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我没有烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.91,0:28:15.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是你运气好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be hard to miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.44,0:28:23.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好看看这刀有多锋利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a moment, eh? Look how sharp it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.36,0:28:29.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要做傻事　我就用这个杀了你　我说到做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You try anything... I will kill you with it,and don't you think I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.03,0:28:42.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你能动弹了就下床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on up when you're able.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.65,0:28:48.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.57,0:29:23.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是弗雷和辛迪·德雷克的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place... It's Fred and Cindy Drake's.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.73,0:29:25.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never met them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.48,0:29:28.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来过　这是他们的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been here.This is their place
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.45,0:29:31.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到时就没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was empty when we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.69,0:29:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别动它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.50,0:29:37.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们被光引过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll see the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.50,0:29:39.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的数量比平时更多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more of them out there than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.08,0:29:43.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前我真不该开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never should have fired that gun today.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.37,0:29:46.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪声把他们都引来了　现在满大街都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sound draws them,now they're all over the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.04,0:29:49.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真蠢啊　居然用枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid... using a gun...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.83,0:29:53.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都发生得太快\N{\fnArial\fs30}It all happened so fast...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.63,0:29:57.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我都没想　-你今天枪杀了个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't think. - You shot that man today.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.39,0:29:58.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.74,0:29:59.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不系淫\N{\fnArial\fs30}No man...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.60,0:30:02.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚说的那是什么浑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that out of your mouth just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.34,0:30:04.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那不是个人　-你用枪打了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It wasn't a man. - You shot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.44,0:30:06.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就大街上　门口　有个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this street,out front,a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.27,0:30:09.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你要戴眼镜了　那是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}For him, you need glasses, that was a walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.64,0:30:11.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.69,0:30:14.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下　别摔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down,before you fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.75,0:30:17.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给　吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.15,0:30:23.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸　祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy... Blessing...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.15,0:30:26.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.43,0:30:43.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天上的父　我们衷心赞美您赐予我们食物…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father,we thank thee for this food... Thy blessings...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.65,0:30:46.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祈求您在天上　庇佑我们熬过这疯狂的时日\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ask you to watch over us in these crazy days.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.85,0:30:48.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-阿门　-阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amen. - Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.03,0:30:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位先生　你究竟知不知道外面发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, mister, do you even know what is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.75,0:31:00.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今天刚醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I woke up today.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.44,0:31:02.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在医院里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.57,0:31:05.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后回到家　就这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came home, that's all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.21,0:31:12.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-但你不知道那些死人吧　-不　我看见很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But you know about the dead people, right? - Yeah, I saw a lot of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.33,0:31:15.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,装卸区遍地都是　还有卡车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out on the loading dock, hauling trucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.09,0:31:19.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不不　不是这些死了的　是那些还在走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No... Not the one's they put down... The one's they didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.91,0:31:22.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.17,0:31:24.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像我今天开枪放倒的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the one I shot today.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.35,0:31:26.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他就要扒了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause he would have ripped into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.21,0:31:29.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要吃了你　至少从你身上挖块肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to eat you, take him some flesh at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.98,0:31:34.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这是你头一回听说　我知道听起来肯定很…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I guess if this is the first you're hearing, I know how it must sound...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.69,0:31:40.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他们都在外面的大街上吗　-对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're out there now, in the street? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.14,0:31:43.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时他们在夜里反而更活跃\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're even more active after dark sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.03,0:31:47.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许是气温低了　该死　估计还是我白天拿枪惹得祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's the cool air or... Hell, maybe it's just me firing up that gun today.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.77,0:31:51.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但只要我们保持安静就很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we'll be fine long as we stay quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.92,0:31:55.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到早上就应该都走光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably wander off by morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.56,0:31:58.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.90,0:32:02.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就说一件事　别被咬\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing I do know... Don't you get bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.34,0:32:06.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们那会看见你的绷带　所以才怕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saw your bandage and that's why we were afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.30,0:32:09.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咬一口就能要你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bites kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.28,0:32:11.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那烧　能直接把你给烧化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fever... burns you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.21,0:32:14.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可再过那么一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then after a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.72,0:32:16.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就又活过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.88,0:32:23.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲眼见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seen it happen...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.11,0:32:30.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.59,0:32:41.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔　是你儿子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl... He your son?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.98,0:32:46.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,威廉　他今天说过这名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}William. He said his name today...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.70,0:32:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还小　比你儿子还小\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a little younger... than your boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.38,0:32:53.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟他妈妈在一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's with his mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.96,0:32:57.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.96,0:33:00.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-爸　-嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.89,0:33:03.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问过他了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ask him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.42,0:33:09.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的枪伤　我跟我儿子打了个小赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your gun shot... We got a little bet going.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.33,0:33:13.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我儿子说你是个抢银行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boy say you're a... bank robber...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.89,0:33:16.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还真猜中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah...That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.81,0:33:19.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.81,0:33:19.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像狄灵杰·卡普(银行抢劫犯)一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deadly as Dillinger Kapow.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.47,0:33:22.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我是县警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff's deputy
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.62,0:33:30.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的　爸爸在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's ok, daddy's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.57,0:33:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.59,0:33:35.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是当中一个撞到了辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them must've bumped a car...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.47,0:33:37.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.25,0:33:39.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前出过这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happened once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.70,0:33:42.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,响了一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went off a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.78,0:33:46.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,熄灯去　德韦恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the light,Dwayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.34,0:34:01.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就那辆蓝的　街那头\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the blue one, down the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.04,0:34:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟上次一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same one as last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.28,0:34:06.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.15,0:34:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个动静　会不会把他们都招来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That noise... Will it bring more of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.48,0:34:14.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在什么都做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing to do about it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.29,0:34:18.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有等到明天他们都散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just have to wait 'em out till morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.05,0:34:23.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.19,0:34:25.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.19,0:34:27.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离窗子远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from the windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.23,0:34:30.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了赶紧走　快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said go! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.74,0:34:38.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.90,0:35:03.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了　给\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ok, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.02,0:35:05.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱着枕头哭吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cry into the pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.65,0:35:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.37,0:35:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.40,0:35:53.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在另一间屋里死了　就在床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}She died in the other room, on that bed...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.25,0:36:00.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么都做不了　那个烧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothin' I can do about it here... That fever, man...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.50,0:36:05.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的皮肤烫得跟火炉似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her skin gave off heat like a furnace...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.72,0:36:16.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早该放倒她的　但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should have put her down, I should have put her down, I know that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.32,0:36:21.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是下不了决心…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what... I just didn't have it in me...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.93,0:36:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是我儿子他娘亲啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the mother of my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.28,0:36:56.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定吗　他们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure? They're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.62,0:36:59.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须得问　至少得再问一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have to ask, at least one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.49,0:37:01.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.43,0:37:03.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了脑里边还有点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for something in the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.73,0:37:06.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是为什么必须打头\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why it's gotta be the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.42,0:37:32.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.57,0:37:35.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我喘口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need a moment
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.74,0:37:41.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.00,0:37:43.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我老婆和儿子 \N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife and son.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.69,0:37:45.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少走的时候还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least they were when they left.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.75,0:37:47.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.70,0:37:48.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the look of this place...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.01,0:37:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卧室里有空的抽屉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found empty drawers in the bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.58,0:37:53.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们带了衣服　不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}They packed some clothes.Not a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.71,0:37:55.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是足够路上用\N{\fnArial\fs30}But enough to travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.27,0:37:58.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也可能是有人闯进来偷走了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know anybody could've broken in here and stolen clothes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.17,0:38:01.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见那些墙上的相框了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see the framed photos on the walls?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.53,0:38:03.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就没见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.66,0:38:06.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪个小偷会要那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some random thief took those too, you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.01,0:38:12.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的照片簿　全家福　都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My photo albums, family pictures, all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.69,0:38:17.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相册\N{\fnArial\fs30}Photo albums...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.27,0:38:24.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我老婆　也是一个样\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife... Same thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.38,0:38:30.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时在收拾生存装备　她却拿什么相册\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here I am, packing survival gear, she's grabbing photo albums....
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.75,0:38:37.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我估计他们会在亚特兰大\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in Atlanta, I'll bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.23,0:38:39.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.73,0:38:42.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么是那　-避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why there? - Refugee settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.95,0:38:46.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很大　至少广播停掉前一直这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huge, when they said it, before the broadcast stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.17,0:38:51.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,军方保护　有吃　有住　他们让人们去那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Military protection food, shelter... They told people to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.56,0:38:53.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说是最安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said to be safest.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.23,0:38:55.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加上他们还有看病的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus they got that disease place.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.35,0:38:56.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,疾控中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Center for Disease Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.04,0:39:00.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说他们正在想办法解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said they were working on how to solve this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.32,0:39:30.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,油和电大概一个月前就都停了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gas and light have been down for maybe a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.50,0:39:32.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警局有自备的丙烷系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Station got its own propane system.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.45,0:39:37.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,设备还管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pilot's still on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.38,0:39:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.98,0:39:43.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,热水耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot water!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.46,0:39:46.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉爽吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That feels good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.57,0:39:48.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊　来啊　来啊　来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it, bring it bring it around ahah
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.42,0:39:51.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}what did you say what
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.45,0:39:59.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,德韦恩　去后面那间屋子换衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dwayne... Dress in room back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.25,0:40:04.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你该说什么　德韦恩　-谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What would you say, Dwayne? - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.00,0:40:12.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来亚特兰大是个好去处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atlanta sounds like a good deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.78,0:40:15.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安全　还有人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safer anyway. People...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.00,0:40:18.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们原本就是要去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where we were heading.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.38,0:40:19.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都乱了套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things got crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.78,0:40:21.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你根本就无法想像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you won't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.17,0:40:22.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐慌蔓延…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The panic... 
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.08,0:40:25.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,街上根本过不去　然后我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Streets won't fit to be on, and then we'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.37,0:40:28.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妻子　走不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife... couldn't travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.88,0:40:32.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟不上队伍　因此我们得找个藏身之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not with our herds, so we had to find a place to lay low.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.60,0:40:35.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她死了之后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then,after she died...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.28,0:40:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就在这里徘徊不前\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just stayed hunkered down.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.62,0:40:43.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们只是不舍得离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we just froze in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.41,0:40:47.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有离开这里的计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan to move on?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.86,0:40:52.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前没这打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't worked up to it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.02,0:41:03.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的枪少了不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of it's gone missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.09,0:41:05.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爸　我能学习开枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, can I learn to shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.86,0:41:07.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经不小了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm old enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.33,0:41:08.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,废话　当然得学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell yes you're going to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.67,0:41:11.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得好好教你　万万不能掉以轻心　\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta do it carefully, teach you to respect the weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.14,0:41:13.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错　这可不是玩具枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. It's not a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.20,0:41:14.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扣动扳机是一件很严肃的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pull the trigger, you have to mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.99,0:41:16.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,切记在心　德韦恩 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Always remember that, Dwayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.52,0:41:18.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是　长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.16,0:41:21.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.82,0:41:25.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.04,0:41:30.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带着这把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.46,0:41:32.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么特别之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.09,0:41:34.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过瞄准精确高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scope's accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.42,0:41:48.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,节约弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conserve your ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.23,0:41:51.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弹药用起来比你想像得要快　尤其是打靶练习时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goes faster than you think. Especially at target practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.30,0:41:54.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,德韦恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dwayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.50,0:41:56.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-啥事　-把这个放车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Take this to the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.70,0:41:59.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们真的不跟我一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you won't come along?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.13,0:42:01.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过些日子再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few more days...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.72,0:42:05.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等德韦恩学会了开枪　我也振作了精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the end, Dwayne will know how to shoot and I won't be so rusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.17,0:42:13.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也带着一个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got one better.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.20,0:42:16.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天黎明时分　我的会开上几分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll turn mine on, a few minutes every day at dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.81,0:42:19.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们到那时　通过这个联系我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get up there, that's how you find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.90,0:42:21.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为他们也在那里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think they're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.16,0:42:23.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以防万一　小心不为过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't afford not to. Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.06,0:42:25.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着　记住这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.76,0:42:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们一般不会单独出动\N{\fnArial\fs30}They may not seem like much one at a time...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.30,0:42:30.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是一群群似饿虎般地蜂拥而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but in a group all round up and hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.82,0:42:32.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟　千万要小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you watch your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.54,0:42:34.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.69,0:42:37.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克　你真是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You a good man, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.33,0:42:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望你们一家能团聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you find your wife and son.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.84,0:42:43.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后会有期　德韦恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be seeing you, Dwayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.79,0:42:45.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照顾好你老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of your old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.44,0:42:47.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是　长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.19,0:42:58.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里昂·贝西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leon Bessi?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.10,0:43:04.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他给我的印象不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't think much of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.93,0:43:10.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又粗心又蠢　但我不能放任不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careless and dumb, but... can't leave him like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.25,0:43:15.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他们会听到枪声的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if they hear the shot.?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.56,0:43:17.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就趁他们出现前　赶紧闪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not be here when they show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.28,0:43:19.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走吧　儿子　快　\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, son. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.85,0:44:54.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这看会漫画\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read your comic books a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.00,0:44:57.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy'll be upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.66,0:46:59.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.54,0:47:01.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系　德韦恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's alright, Dwayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.29,0:47:04.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,儿子　你待在下面　别上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay there, son. Don't come up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.96,0:47:35.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊　宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.84,0:48:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很遗憾你变成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry this happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.48,0:49:04.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油　你能行的　\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.72,0:49:58.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧急频道呼叫中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broadcasting on emergency channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.79,0:50:01.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们正沿着85号洲际公路开往亚特兰大\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be approaching Atlanta on Highway 85.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.76,0:50:04.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到请回话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody reads, please respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.85,0:50:08.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂　有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.84,0:50:11.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有人听得到我的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can anybody hear my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.18,0:50:17.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人在听吗　收到请回话　　\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody out there? Anybody hears me, please respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.17,0:50:21.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂　听得到我的声音吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, can you hear my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.25,0:50:24.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗　可以听到我的声音吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Hello? Can anybody hear my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.68,0:50:27.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以　我可以听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.96,0:50:29.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要过来了　完毕　　\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming through. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.69,0:50:32.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到请回话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody who reads, please respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.28,0:50:35.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧急频道呼叫中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broadcasting on emergency channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.44,0:50:38.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们正沿着85号洲际公路开往亚特兰大\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be approaching Atlanta on Highway 85.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.34,0:50:40.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到请回话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody reads, please respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.80,0:50:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就在城外\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just outside the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.54,0:50:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.17,0:50:50.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂　喂　\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.09,0:50:52.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他听不到我的声音　我没办法提醒他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He couldn't hear me. I couldn't warn him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.50,0:50:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用无线电再联系他试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to raise him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.85,0:50:56.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来　孩子　这玩意你最拿手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, son. You know best how to work this thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.78,0:51:01.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂　呼叫人还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, hello, is the person who calls still on the air?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.57,0:51:05.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是肖恩·威尔士警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is officer Shane Walsh,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.66,0:51:08.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呼叫不明人士　请回话\N{\fnArial\fs30}broadcasting a person unknown, please respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.41,0:51:16.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.48,0:51:19.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有人还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are others.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.74,0:51:21.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只有我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.16,0:51:21.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊　意料之中　\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, We knew there would be, right, 
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.94,0:51:23.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因此民用波段电台才一直开着\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's why we let the CB on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.16,0:51:25.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这电台的确挺有用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of good it's been doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.10,0:51:27.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该在85号公路上放些标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've been saying for a week,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.61,0:51:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来提醒人们远离城里\N{\fnArial\fs30}we ought to put signs up on 85 
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.30,0:51:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这话我都说了一星期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to warn people away from the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.65,0:51:32.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们不知道如今城里已是行尸的天下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Folks got no idea what they're getting into.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.87,0:51:35.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有足够的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have enough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.44,0:51:38.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得腾出时间来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we need to make time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.50,0:51:42.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个…　这一点我们无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that, uh... That's a luxury we can't afford.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.37,0:51:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有幸活下来　活一天算一天　\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are surviving here. We are day to day.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.63,0:51:47.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你建议派谁去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who the hell would you propose to send?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.63,0:51:49.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去　给我辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go. Give me a vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.56,0:51:51.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道谁都不准单独行动　\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody goes anywhere alone, you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.53,0:51:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是　长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.86,0:52:00.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停　别跟上　过去坐下　孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, come on, take a sit, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.78,0:52:02.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事　去吧　没事的　\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alright, go on, you're alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.59,0:52:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么　在生我的气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you're pissed at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.56,0:52:13.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再怎么气　也改变不了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well pissing me all you want won't gonna change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.10,0:52:16.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让你陷于险境\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not putting you in danger, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.03,0:52:18.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何都不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not doing it for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.75,0:52:19.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道有时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make you feel like
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.02,0:52:22.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很想扇我耳光…\N{\fnArial\fs30}sometimes you wanna slap me outside the head...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.18,0:52:22.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就直说了吧　美女 \N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.86,0:52:24.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想扇的话　别客气　尽管扇　\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel that need, you go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.28,0:52:25.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我人就在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.34,0:52:32.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能总这样气冲冲地半路走掉　\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot walk off like that, all half-cocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.13,0:52:35.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你若不想为你我放弃这念头的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if you don't wanna do it for my sake or for your sake,　
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.68,0:52:36.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这我管不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.14,0:52:39.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是　为了他你就好好待着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just... You do it for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.60,0:52:43.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你儿子经历了太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}That boy has been through too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.26,0:52:45.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不能再失去他的妈妈　好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's not losing his mother too, ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.45,0:52:49.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好　-好　好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Ok, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.32,0:52:55.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己答应了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.09,0:53:03.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不难吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.61,0:53:23.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.81,0:53:29.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼　她在里面　进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, buddy? She's in there, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.96,0:53:34.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想让你担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.35,0:53:36.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哪儿也不去了　好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom is not going anywhere. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.13,0:53:39.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗　高兴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.48,0:53:41.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-去把活干完　-好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go finish your chores. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.10,0:54:25.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.07,0:54:29.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police officer out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.51,0:54:34.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能借点汽油吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I borrow some gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.36,0:54:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.17,0:54:53.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗　有人在家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Anybody home?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.26,0:55:24.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(上帝请宽恕我们)
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.47,0:56:42.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放轻松　别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy now, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.39,0:56:44.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.34,0:56:46.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会动你一根汗毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.81,0:56:50.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们打个商量吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like a proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.20,0:56:53.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺路南下就能到亚特兰大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atlanta's just down the road ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.12,0:56:54.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's safe there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.49,0:56:58.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包吃包住　有人　还有你的同类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food, shelter, people, other horses too, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.89,0:57:02.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这主意怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.28,0:57:08.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,套上了　真乖　真听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go. Good boy. Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.03,0:57:11.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在跟我走吧　跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now come with me. Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.74,0:57:24.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们慢慢来　好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go easy, ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.91,0:57:27.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好几年没骑马了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't done this for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.75,0:57:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别急　慢慢来　别急　慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy. Easy, boy. Easy, easy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.77,0:59:48.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,镇定　几个而已　咱们有无敌马腿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady. It's just a few. Nothing we can't outrun.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.92,0:59:59.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.20,1:02:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洛莉　卡尔　对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori, Carl, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.24,1:05:07.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.75,1:05:12.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dumb ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.28,1:05:15.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你　躲坦克里的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you in the tank.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.40,1:05:17.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面还舒服吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cozy in there?
